WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:02.660
This is Kalle Koljonen

00:00:02.660 --> 00:00:03.960
And Joonas Korhonen

00:00:03.960 --> 00:00:06.760
Two Finnish national team badminton players

00:00:06.880 --> 00:00:08.820
We'll challenge them to a game of badminton

00:00:08.820 --> 00:00:11.160
But we will all play with table tennis rackets

00:00:11.160 --> 00:00:12.740
