00:02:29.500 --> 00:02:31.300
Good job we had our secret practice session

00:02:57.820 --> 00:02:58.540
Red dragon?

00:02:58.540 --> 00:02:59.920
We'll use the red dragon!

00:03:03.820 --> 00:03:05.920
